AuraDE recovery console

Nothing was started here. The other three entries in the boot menu start the
installer for you.

    aurade-installer-start          install AuraDE
    aurade-installer-start --help   the other ways to start it
    aurade-recovery --help          roll a system back, collect evidence

The installer asks a few questions, shows what it will do, and does not touch
any disk until you confirm that disk by name.

This console is signed in as root with no password.
That account is not copied to the installed system.
Treat this machine as unlocked until it restarts.
